{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261BfREZMUCZ1794349369.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價普遍較低。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合141.03元，比本港收市低2.27元。工商銀行7.93元，低6仙。建設銀行10.6元，低4仙。友邦保險78.87元，低0.48元。港交所382.62元，低3.78元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股413.53元，低4.27元。阿里巴巴100.73元，低0.87元。理想汽車48.99元，低1.36元。金沙中國11.13元，低0.15元。長和71.31元，低0.64元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:08:49.112385+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T22:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T04:25:35.455550+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T23:02:03.420666+00:00","content_hash":"0f598d03dd24efaf2db712b39616fbdedb7b1ea1a12ca6c5b4965bda3e755174","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:08:49.112385+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}